{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の鈴木佑捺です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日は乃木恋の彼氏イベントがありました！！\nありがとうございました💞"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回は「カラオケデート」テーマに\n歌ったりお悩み相談室をしたり…\n私らしい空間になっていたかな？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リクエストしていただいた曲がどれも私の大好きな曲で、みなさんと同じだな〜なんて思ったりもしました(^ ^)うれしかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobmgTF4p.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobLYfbLW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobwAZJek.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobYRtW1p.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きな衣装と一緒に、夢のような時間でした(^ ^)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とにかく温かくて楽しくてあっという間でした☺️\n私もみんなのことをぽかぽかにできていたらうれしいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして最近はアンダーライブに向けてリハーサルに取り組んでいます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩方が作ってきてくださった、その場所をしっかり守れるようにリスペクトを持って頑張ります🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "チケットの一般先着販売＆配信も決定しました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/s/n46/page/underlive"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします🙇🏻‍♀️\n本番ぎりぎりまで自主練たくさん頑張るぞ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ寒い日が続きますが、健康第一！\n一緒にがんばろうね✊🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回は短いブログでごめんなさい😭\nまたすぐに書きます！！\n月曜日お疲れさまでした✩.*˚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "佑捺"}], "source": "official"}